# Mercur documentation (MCP)

This repo has the **Mercur MCP** server configured in `.cursor/mcp.json`. Use **SearchMercurJsDocumentation** for live Mercur/Medusa docs.

## Use Mercur MCP for

- Medusa workflows, modules, links, subscribers
- Vendor and admin API routes
- Stripe Connect, payouts, commissions
- Mercur blocks, CLI, registry, migrations
- Code in `apps/backend/` and `packages/modules/*`

## Use local docs for

- Supabase platform schema, creators, workshops, events, articles
- Creator dashboard, Dutch UX, senior-friendly UI
- `entity_links` graph and platform-first architecture

See `AGENTS.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, and `docs/agents.md`.

## Version caveat

This codebase is **Mercur 1.5.4** (`apps/backend`, `packages/modules/*`). MCP docs describe **Mercur 2.x** (blocks, `packages/api`, CLI). Treat MCP results as patterns to adapt — not drop-in file paths.
